2026-07-27T10:27:13.3070255Z i /tmp/RtmpOHgs2i/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:27:13.3070567Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:27:13.3070928Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:27:13.3071243Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:27:13.3071744Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:27:13.3073082Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:27:13.3073811Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
